&lt;li&gt;Strong project management skills with the ability to manage multiple priorities and deadlines.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent communication and relationship-building skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A keen interest in science, healthcare and the pharmaceutical industry.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Confidence working with cross-functional teams and a range of stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
