&lt;div class=&quot;x_x_elementToProof&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;x_x_elementToProof&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;📍 Based in Boulogne-Billancourt, Paris (hybrid: 3 days office, 2 days working from home)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;x_x_elementToProof&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;💬 Fluent in English&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;x_x_elementToProof&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;📅 CDD to End September 2027&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;x_x_elementToProof&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;x_x_elementToProof&quot;&gt;Imagine seeing your designs come to life at some of the world&#39;s biggest sporting events?&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;x_x_elementToProof&quot;&gt;HBS is a global leader in sports broadcasting; become part of the team behind some of the world&#39;s most prestigious sporting events.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;x_x_elementToProof&quot;&gt;We&#39;re looking for an experienced Project Architect to lead the design and delivery of workplace, broadcast and event infrastructure projects supporting events like the FIFA Women&#39;s World Cup 2027 and EURO 2028.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;x_x_elementToProof&quot;&gt;This is a rare opportunity to work on large-scale temporary structures and operational facilities from concept through to implementation, collaborating with multidisciplinary teams and seeing your designs realised on site.&lt;/div&gt;
