&lt;li&gt;Experience managing projects through multiple design stages&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in leading and managing a small team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent written and spoken English, with the ability to communicate architectural and technical concepts professionally&lt;/li&gt;
